/S /Figure
/P 9002 0 R
/Alt (The figure shows the client-side process regarding the interaction with a server that implements HLBS. It starts with the service-device combination selection, the configuration of the service, followed by the start of the service execution. When an feedback element is fetched, the user interface SHALL update. In case the process is regarded as finished the results are fetched, otherwise the next feedback element is fetched. After the results are fetched, the service-device combination is released. At any point of the process \(or indepentent from it\) a button press by the user signals a user command to the server. )
